{"schema":"s10y-choice-draft-v1","questions":[{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"哪些有序数对是方程 $x^2-3xy+y^2=31$ 的解？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$(3+2\\sqrt2,3-2\\sqrt2)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(-3,-11)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(2,3)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(3,-2)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"$(3,11)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"$(-2,3)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"在实数范围内，哪张表正确列出了每个方程的有序数对解的个数？\n\n$E_1:(x^2-7)(y^2+4)=0$；$E_2:(x-2y)(x^2+1)=0$；$E_3:(x^2-9)(y^2-4)=0$；$E_4:(x^2-9)^2+(y^2-4)^2=0$；$E_5:(x-y)(x^2+y^2)=0$；$E_6:(x-y)^2+(y-1)^2=0$。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"| 方程 | $E_1$ | $E_2$ | $E_3$ | $E_4$ | $E_5$ | $E_6$ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 解的个数 | 无限多 | 无限多 | 4 | 4 | 无限多 | 1 |","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"| 方程 | $E_1$ | $E_2$ | $E_3$ | $E_4$ | $E_5$ | $E_6$ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 解的个数 | 无限多 | 无限多 | 无限多 | 无限多 | 无限多 | 无限多 |","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"| 方程 | $E_1$ | $E_2$ | $E_3$ | $E_4$ | $E_5$ | $E_6$ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 解的个数 | 无限多 | 无限多 | 无限多 | 4 | 无限多 | 1 |","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"设 $x,y$ 为实数。哪些等式及下界成立，因而能证明相应表达式不可能等于零？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$x^2+8x+y^2+17=(x+4)^2+y^2+13\\ge13$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$x^2+8x+y^2+17=(x+4)^2+y^2+1\\ge1$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$x^2-10x+y^2+100=(x-5)^2+y^2+75\\ge75$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$x^2-10x+y^2+100=(x-10)^2+y^2\\ge100$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"$x^2-2xy+2y^2+4y+7=(x-y)^2+(y+2)^2+3\\ge3$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"$x^2-2xy+y^2+8=(x-y)^2+8\\ge8$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"在实数范围内，哪些论证正确给出了相应方程的唯一解？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$2x^2-6xy+9y^2-10x+25=0$ 等价于 $(x-3y)^2+(x-5)^2=0$，故唯一解是 $(5,15)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$x^2+6x+y^2-10y=-34$ 等价于 $(x+3)^2+(y-5)^2=0$，故唯一解是 $(-3,5)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$x^2+6x+y^2-10y=-34$ 等价于 $(x+3)^2+(y-5)^2=0$，故唯一解是 $(3,-5)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$2x^2-6xy+9y^2-10x+25=0$ 等价于 $(x-3y)^2+(x-5)^2=0$，故唯一解是 $(5,\\frac53)$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"以下关于二元方程的实数有序数对解的个数，哪些说法正确？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$y^2+x^2(x-1)^2(x+1)^2=0$ 恰有三个解。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$(x^2-1)y=0$ 恰有两个解。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$x^2+y^2+1=0$ 没有解。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$y^2+(x^2-1)^2=0$ 恰有四个解。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"$x^2+y^2=0$ 恰有一个解。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"$y^2+(x^2-1)^2=0$ 恰有两个解。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"哪些方程至少有一个整数有序数对解？含分母的方程只在分母非零时有意义。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$xy=-7.5$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$x-\\frac7{y^2}=1$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$3x-3y=4$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$x^2-y^2=11$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"$xy=13$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"$\\frac1x+\\frac1y=\\frac16$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"点 $A(5,-4)$ 对应方程 $x^3+2y^2+3=0$，点 $B(7,-3)$ 对应方程 $x^2-7x^2y-11xy^3+10x-19y+24=0$。哪项给出了正确的代入结果与图像归属？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"两个左边的值依次为 $-90,3308$；两个点都不在各自的图像上。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"两个左边的值依次为 $160,3308$；两个点都不在各自的图像上。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"两个左边的值依次为 $160,-3022$；两个点都不在各自的图像上。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"在实数坐标平面内，哪些描述给出了相应方程的整个图像？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$x^2-y^2=0$：直线 $y=x$ 与直线 $y=-x$ 的并集。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$x^2-y^2=0$：只含直线 $y=x$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$(x-1)(y-x)=0$：直线 $x=1$ 与直线 $y=x$ 的并集。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$(x-4)(y-3)=0$：只含点 $(4,3)$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"$(x-4)(y-3)=0$：直线 $x=4$ 与直线 $y=3$ 的并集。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"$(xy-6)(x+y)=0$：双曲线 $xy=6$ 与直线 $y=-x$ 的并集。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"哪些描述给出了相应方程在实数坐标平面内的整个图像？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$|x|+|y|=4$：依次连接 $(4,0),(0,4),(-4,0),(0,-4),(4,0)$ 的四条线段。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$|x|+|y|=4$：区域 $|x|+|y|\\le4$，包括边界和内部。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$|x|+y=4$：$y=4-|x|$，由顶点 $(0,4)$ 向左右下方延伸的两条射线。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$|x|+|y|=x+y$：区域 $x\\ge0,y\\ge0$，包括两条非负半轴。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"$|x|+|y|=x+y$：只有 $x\\ge0,y\\ge0$ 的两条坐标半轴。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"$x+|y|=4$：$x=4-|y|$，由顶点 $(4,0)$ 向左上、左下延伸的两条射线。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"比较 $|x|y=6$ 与 $|xy|=6$ 的完整图像。哪项给出了正确的分支和定义域？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$|x|y=6$ 与 $|xy|=6$ 均为 $y=\\pm6/|x|$ 的四条分支；两者均要求 $x\\ne0$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$|x|y=6$ 与 $|xy|=6$ 均为 $y=6/|x|$ 的两条上方分支；两者均要求 $x\\ne0$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$|x|y=6$ 是 $y=6/|x|$ 的两条上方分支；$|xy|=6$ 是 $y=\\pm6/|x|$ 的四条分支；两者均要求 $x\\ne0$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"哪组完整图像描述与方程 $y=-5/x$ 和 $xy=7.5$ 分别对应？每组先描述前一个方程，再描述后一个方程。","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"第一条是位于第二、第四象限的双曲线，经过 $(-1,5)$、$(1,-5)$、$(-5,1)$、$(5,-1)$；第二条是位于第一、第三象限的双曲线，经过 $(1,7.5)$、$(3,2.5)$、$(-1,-7.5)$、$(-3,-2.5)$。两条完整曲线都以两坐标轴为渐近线，不含坐标轴上的点。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"第一条是位于第二、第四象限的双曲线，经过 $(-1,1)$、$(1,-1)$、$(-5,0.2)$、$(5,-0.2)$；第二条是位于第一、第三象限的双曲线，经过 $(1,7.5)$、$(3,2.5)$、$(-1,-7.5)$、$(-3,-2.5)$。两条完整曲线都以两坐标轴为渐近线，不含坐标轴上的点。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"第一条是位于第二、第四象限的双曲线，经过 $(-1,5)$、$(1,-5)$、$(-5,1)$、$(5,-1)$；第二条是位于第一、第三象限的双曲线，经过 $(1,1)$、$(3,1/3)$、$(-1,-1)$、$(-3,-1/3)$。两条完整曲线都以两坐标轴为渐近线，不含坐标轴上的点。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"方程 $x^2+y^2=49$、$x^2+y^2=48$、$x^2+y^2=42.25$、$x^2+y^2=20.25$ 的图像都是以原点为圆心的圆周。哪项按此顺序给出了它们的半径？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$3.5,\\ 2\\sqrt3,\\ 3.25,\\ 2.25$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$49,\\ 48,\\ 42.25,\\ 20.25$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$7,\\ 4\\sqrt3,\\ 6.5,\\ 4.5$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"已知圆周 $x^2+y^2=r^2$ 经过 $A(a,b)$。哪些点必定也在这个圆周上？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$E(b,a)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$B(-a,b)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$M(-b,-a)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$D(a,-b)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"E","text":"$K(-b,a)$","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"F","text":"$C(-a,-b)$","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"圆周 $x^2+y^2=r^2$ 经过 $A(8,15)$。点 $B(7,16)$、$C(9,14)$、$D(-1,12\\sqrt2)$ 相对于这个圆周的位置依次是什么？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"圆外、圆内、圆内。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"圆外、圆内、圆周上。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"圆周上、圆周上、圆内。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"圆内、圆外、圆周上。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"圆周 $x^2+y^2=10$ 与双曲线 $xy=3$ 的全部实数交点构成哪个集合？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(3,-1),(1,-3),(-1,3),(-3,1)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(3,1),(1,3),(-1,-3),(-3,-1)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\{(10,6),(6,10),(-6,-10),(-10,-6)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"求两组曲线各自的全部实数交点。$G_1$：$x+y=8$ 与 $x^2+y^2=81$；$G_2$：$2x+y=11$ 与 $x^2+y^2=25$。哪项给出了完整结果？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$G_1:\\{(4+7\\sqrt2,4-7\\sqrt2),(4-7\\sqrt2,4+7\\sqrt2)\\}$；$G_2:\\{(4,3),(\\frac{24}5,\\frac75)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$G_1:\\{(4+\\frac{7\\sqrt2}2,4-\\frac{7\\sqrt2}2),(4-\\frac{7\\sqrt2}2,4+\\frac{7\\sqrt2}2)\\}$；$G_2:\\{(4,3),(\\frac{24}5,\\frac75)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$G_1:\\{(4+\\frac{7\\sqrt2}2,4-\\frac{7\\sqrt2}2),(4-\\frac{7\\sqrt2}2,4+\\frac{7\\sqrt2}2)\\}$；$G_2:\\{(4,-3),(\\frac{24}5,-\\frac75)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"直线 $x-y=1$ 与双曲线 $xy=-12$ 的全部实数交点构成哪个集合？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(\\frac{1+\\sqrt{47}}2,\\frac{-1+\\sqrt{47}}2),(\\frac{1-\\sqrt{47}}2,\\frac{-1-\\sqrt{47}}2)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(4,3),(-3,-4)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\varnothing$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"抛物线 $y=x^2$ 与直线 $3x+2y=3$ 的全部实数交点构成哪个集合？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(\\frac{-3+\\sqrt{33}}4,\\frac{21-3\\sqrt{33}}8),(\\frac{-3-\\sqrt{33}}4,\\frac{21+3\\sqrt{33}}8)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(\\frac{-3+\\sqrt{33}}2,\\frac{21-3\\sqrt{33}}2),(\\frac{-3-\\sqrt{33}}2,\\frac{21+3\\sqrt{33}}2)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\{(\\frac{-3+\\sqrt{33}}4,\\frac{-3+\\sqrt{33}}4),(\\frac{-3-\\sqrt{33}}4,\\frac{-3-\\sqrt{33}}4)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"曲线 $y+x+x^2=0$ 与直线 $x-y=10$ 的全部实数交点构成哪个集合？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(-1+\\sqrt{11},9+\\sqrt{11}),(-1-\\sqrt{11},9-\\sqrt{11})\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(1+\\sqrt{11},-9+\\sqrt{11}),(1-\\sqrt{11},-9-\\sqrt{11})\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\{(-1+\\sqrt{11},-11+\\sqrt{11}),(-1-\\sqrt{11},-11-\\sqrt{11})\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"在实数范围内，哪项给出了两组方程各自的完整解集？\n\n$H_1:\\begin{cases}x+xy-y=7,\\\\2x-y=-1;\\end{cases}$\n$H_2:\\begin{cases}4x-xy+3y=19,\\\\x+2y=-2.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$H_1:\\{(2,5),(-2,-3)\\}$；$H_2:\\{(-11,\\frac92),(4,-3)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$H_1:\\{(2,5),(-2,-3)\\}$；$H_2:\\{(-11,\\frac92),(-8,3)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$H_1:\\{(2,3),(-2,-5)\\}$；$H_2:\\{(-11,\\frac92),(4,-3)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"在实数范围内，哪项给出了两组方程各自的完整解？\n\n$L_1:\\begin{cases}2x-y=1,\\\\7x-y=9;\\end{cases}$\n$L_2:\\begin{cases}x-4y=5,\\\\x+8y=-7.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$L_1:\\{(2,3)\\}$；$L_2:\\{(1,-1)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$L_1:\\{(\\frac85,\\frac{11}5)\\}$；$L_2:\\{(9,1)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$L_1:\\{(\\frac85,\\frac{11}5)\\}$；$L_2:\\{(1,-1)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"在实数范围内，哪项给出了两组方程各自的全部有序数对解？\n\n$P_1:\\begin{cases}xy=48,\\\\x+2y=20;\\end{cases}$\n$P_2:\\begin{cases}3x-2y=6,\\\\xy=120.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$P_1:\\{(12,4),(8,6)\\}$；$P_2:\\{(10,18),(-8,-9)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$P_1:\\{(12,4),(8,6)\\}$；$P_2:\\{(10,12),(-8,-15)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$P_1:\\{(4,12),(6,8)\\}$；$P_2:\\{(10,12),(-8,-15)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"求实数方程组的完整解集：$\\begin{cases}4x^2-9y^2+x-40y-19=0,\\\\2x-3y=5.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(1,-1)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(1,4)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\{(4,1)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"求实数方程组的完整解集：$\\begin{cases}3x^2+y^2+8x+13y=5,\\\\x-y+2=0.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(-\\frac54,\\frac34),(-5,-3)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(\\frac{11}4,\\frac34),(-1,-3)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\{(-\\frac12,\\frac32),(-8,-6)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"求实数方程组的完整解集：$\\begin{cases}2x^2-3y^2-5x-2y=26,\\\\x-y=4.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(2,-2),(-3,-7)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(6,2),(11,7)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\{(2,6),(7,11)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"求实数方程组的完整解集：$\\begin{cases}2x+y-11=0,\\\\2x+5y-y^2-6=0.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(5,3),(-1,6)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(3,5),(6,-1)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\{(3,5),(5,1)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"求实数方程组的完整解集：$\\begin{cases}x+3y=-1,\\\\x^2+2xy+y^2=3.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(\\frac{-1+\\sqrt3}2,\\frac{-1-\\sqrt3}2),(\\frac{-1-\\sqrt3}2,\\frac{-1+\\sqrt3}2)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(5,-2),(-4,1)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\{(\\frac{1+3\\sqrt3}2,\\frac{-1-\\sqrt3}2),(\\frac{1-3\\sqrt3}2,\\frac{-1+\\sqrt3}2)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"求实数方程组的完整解集：$\\begin{cases}2x-y=1,\\\\xy-y^2+3x=-1.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(0,-1),(3,5)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(0,1),(3,7)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\{(3,5)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"$r$ 为实数。方程组 $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=r^2,\\\\x+y=6\\end{cases}$ 在什么条件下没有实数解？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$r<3\\sqrt2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$0\\le r<3\\sqrt2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$-3\\sqrt2\\le r\\le3\\sqrt2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$-3\\sqrt2<r<3\\sqrt2$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"$c$ 为实数。方程组 $\\begin{cases}x^2+y^2=100,\\\\x+y=c\\end{cases}$ 在什么条件下有实数解？","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$-10\\sqrt2<c<10\\sqrt2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$-10\\sqrt2\\le c\\le10\\sqrt2$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$-20\\le c\\le20$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"D","text":"$-10\\le c\\le10$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"求实数方程组的完整解集，其中 $x\\ne0,y\\ne0$：$\\begin{cases}x-y=2,\\\\\\frac{x}{y}-\\frac{y}{x}=\\frac56.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(6,4),(\\frac45,-\\frac65)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(4,6),(-\\frac65,\\frac45)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\{(6,4)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"求实数方程组的完整解集，其中 $x\\ne0,y\\ne0$：$\\begin{cases}x+y=14,\\\\\\frac{x}{y}+\\frac{y}{x}=2\\frac1{12}.\\end{cases}$","figure_ids":[],"options":[{"id":"A","text":"$\\{(7,7)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"B","text":"$\\{(6,8),(8,6)\\}$。","figure_ids":[]},{"id":"C","text":"$\\varnothing$。","figure_ids":[]}]}},{"view":{"mode":"single","stem":"求实数方程组的完整解集，其中 $x\\ne0,y\\ne0$：$\\begin{cases}\\frac1x-\\frac1y=\\frac1{20},\\\\x+2y=14.\\end{c